OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA chilly start, but staying
OL,6,Fmainly dry and bright with some sunny
OL,7,Fspells. However, there will be a
OL,8,Fscattering of showers. Light or
OL,9,Fmoderate west or northwest winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FCloudy or partly cloudy
OL,12,Fduring this evening and overnight with
OL,13,Foccasional showers, these mainly
OL,14,Facross the Northwest Highlands. Some
OL,15,Fearly clear spells further east. Touch
OL,16,Fof frost possible.
OL,17,
OL,18,CMonday:FMainly dry with bright spells
OL,19,Fand the odd shower. A few sunny or
OL,20,Fclear spells and winds remaining light.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
